       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MOVECORRDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 INPUT-REC.
           05 CUST-ID     PIC 9(5) VALUE 12345.
           05 CUST-NAME   PIC X(10) VALUE "ALICE".
           05 BALANCE     PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 250.75.
           05 INPUT-ONLY  PIC X(4) VALUE "TEMP".
       01 OUTPUT-REC.
           05 CUST-NAME   PIC X(10).
           05 CUST-ID     PIC 9(7).
           05 BALANCE     PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 OUTPUT-ONLY PIC X(4) VALUE "KEEP".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING INPUT-REC TO OUTPUT-REC
           DISPLAY "ID:      " CUST-ID OF OUTPUT-REC
           DISPLAY "NAME:    " CUST-NAME OF OUTPUT-REC
           DISPLAY "BALANCE: " BALANCE OF OUTPUT-REC
           DISPLAY "UNMATCHED FIELD STAYS: " OUTPUT-ONLY
           ADD CORRESPONDING INPUT-REC TO OUTPUT-REC
           DISPLAY "AFTER ADD CORRESPONDING: " BALANCE OF OUTPUT-REC
           STOP RUN.
